  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "38",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 38"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "38",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeremia ore ase engoro ere netintira",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono Sefatia, mosinto o Matani, na Gedalia, mosinto o Pasuri, na Yukali, mosinto o Selemia, na Pasuri, mosinto o Malikia, mbaigwete ekero Yeremia akwanete nabaanto bonsi akabateebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aya nar’Omonene agoteeba: Omonto oratigare kobeera ase omochie oyo naitwe n’omoro, gose nenchara, gose noborwaire bogoita, korende oyo orasoke korwa aiga, na erue ase Abakalidayo, oyio nagenderere koba moyo. Oyio natooreke, tabaisa goitwa ase esegi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya nar’Omonene agoteeba: Ekeene, omochie oyo nobekwe ase amaboko ’abasikari b’omorwoti o Babiloni obe oyobo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abanene b’oborwoti bagateebia omorwoti, “Tiga omonto oyo aitwe. Nigo agoita emioyo y’abasikari batigarete ase omochie oyo, amo ney’abaanto bonsi ase okobateebia amang’ana buna ayio. Omonto oyo taganereti abanto amang’ana amaya, korende nigo abaganeretie amabe basire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zedekia omorwoti agateebia abagaambi baria, “Rora nigo are ase amaboko aino, ekiagera inche omorwoti tinkonyara gokora amang’ana are mamincha yaino.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abagaambi abwo bakaira Yeremia, bakamotirimbokeria chingori gochia ase engoro ya Malikia, omomura bw’omorwoti. Engoro eyio nigo yarenge ase egoora y’abarendi tiyarenge namaache, korende netintira yoka yarengeo; na Yeremia akarateera imeo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebedi‐Meleki Omoetiopia, omokoreri bw’enyomba y’omorwoti, akaigwa ng’a abagaambi baria babekire Yeremia ime ase engoro eria. Ekero ekio omorwoti nigo aikaransete ase Egeita kia Benjamini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio Ebedi‐Meleki akarua ase enyomba y’omorwoti, akagenda ase omorwoti arenge, agakwana nere, akamoteebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye omorwoti, omonene one, abanto bakorire bobe mono ase amang’ana onsi bakorire ase Yeremia omobani ase okomobeka ime ase engoro eria. Bono ere nigo arakwereo ase engencho y’enchara, ekiagera emegati yonsi yaerire korwa ase omochie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omorwoti agachiika Ebedi‐Meleki, Omoetiopia oria, akamoteebia, “Ira abanto emerongo etato korwa aiga, ogende amo nabarabwo, na morusie Yeremia omobani korwa ase engoro ime, atarakwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, Ebedi‐Meleki akagenda amo nabaanto baria ase enyomba ase ekenunchi, inse ye rigachero, akarusia korwa aroro amachanchabe ne chianga chingotu, agachisiba chingori, agachitirimbokia gochia ase engoro inse ase Yeremia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebedi‐Meleki, Omoetiopia oria, agateebia Yeremia, “Agia chianga echio ase chintigatigi chiao, oagie ne chingori korwa inse.” Yeremia agakora bo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto abwo bakang’usa Yeremia ne chingori chiria korwa ase engoro eria, bakamorusiao. Na Yeremia akagenderera kobeera ase egoora y’abarendi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Zedekia okoboria Yeremia amosemie",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ayio Zedekia omorwoti agatoma abanto ase Yeremia omobani bakamorenta asare agwo ase egesoero kia gatato ki’Enyomba y’Omonene. Erio omorwoti agakwana na Yeremia, akamoteebia, “Ngokoboria inde ring’ana; tobaisa kombisa gento kende gionsi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeremia akairaneria Zedekia, akabora, “Ndagoteebia ring’ana erio, Inee, nobe nobomaene ng’a tokong’ita? Naende ndagoteebia amang’ana ay’okogosemia, nontegerere?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Zedekia omorwoti agatiana bobisi ase Yeremia, akabora, “Ekeene, buna Omonene are moyo, oria ototongete agatoa obogima obo, tinkonyara kogoita gose gokobeeka ase amaboko ’abaanto abwo bakorigia basirie obogima bwao.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yeremia agateebia Zedekia, “Aya nar’Omonene, Nyasae bw’Emeganda, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, agoteeba: Aye korerue ase amaboko ay’abakogamba inse y’omorwoti o Babiloni, notigwe obe moyo, na omochie oyo togosambwa nomorero; aye amo nabaanto b’eamate yao namotigwe mobe moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende koraange kwerua ase abagaambi baria b’omorwoti o Babiloni, rirorio omochie oyo nobekwe ase amaboko ’Abakalidayo, na barabwo mbayosambe nomorero, naye omonyene tokorua ase amaboko abo otooreke.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zedekia omorwoti akairaneria Yeremia, akamoteebia, “Noboire Abayahudi baria batamete bakabwatana n’Abakalidayo. Inse kwerua, nigo ndabaise gochia kobekwa ase amaboko abo, na barabwo banchecherie ase ogonchanda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeremia akamoteebia, “Tokobekwa ase amaboko abo. Igwera amang’ana ’Omonene aya nkogoteebia, erio nario amang’ana arabe amaya asore, aye notigwe obe moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene onyorokirie amang’ana arabe asore onye gokwanga kwerua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amang’ana ayio naro aya: Abakungu bonsi barache gotigwa ase enyomba y’omorwoti bw’Abayuda mbairwe gochia ase abagaambi bare inse y’omorwoti o Babiloni. Nigo barabe bagokwana iga:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "“Abasani bao kwegenete nigo bakong’ainete,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "barabwo bagakobua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bono amagoro ao arateerire ase etintira,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "abwo beonchoire, bagotigire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abakungu bao bonsi na abana bao abamura nabairwe ase Abakalidayo, naye omonyene tokorwa ase amaboko abo otooreke, korende omorwoti o Babiloni nakobwate; na omochie oyo nosambwe nomorero.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Zedekia agateebia Yeremia omobani, “Tobaisa goteebia monto onde amang’ana aya twakwanire naye. Oise goteebia onde ayio, goika okwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende abanene baria b’oborwoti kobaraigwe amang’ana ng’a inche nakwana naye, naende bachiche asore bakoborie ng’a obateebie amang’ana gwakwana nainche omorwoti, na ninki nagoteebia, bagokoboria ng’a tobabisa gento ng’a nario batagoite,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
